@startuml selma_compilation_pipeline
' ============================================================
' Selma — Hermetic Compilation / CG-IR Pipeline
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §2.4, §2.6, §2.7, §2.8, §2.9, §3.4, §3.5
'          User_Stories.md S-05, S-21..S-24, S-27, S-31
' C4:      Hermetic Compiler → Compiled Rules Adapter → cgir_store
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Invariants: hermetic frozen_env · all-or-nothing · SHA-256 CAS
'             compiled_at excluded from snapshot hash (S-23)
'             policy_doctrine.yaml never at runtime (AA-02)
' Ownership / concurrency: README.md
' ============================================================

title Selma — Hermetic Compilation / CG-IR Pipeline\n<size:12><i>All-or-nothing publish · content-addressed · no runtime policy dependency</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Requested : <b>compile request</b>\nactor: System | CI/CD\ncommand: directive change | scheduled compile\nevent: CompileRequested

state "Requested" as Requested #B9770E : **entry** request_id assigned\n**allowed** dedup by (graph version + frozen_env)\n**forbidden** partial CG-IR write
state "Queued" as Queued #B9770E : **entry** FIFO queue\n**allowed** writer-preference scheduling\n**forbidden** skip lock (§3.4)
state "Acquire\nRead Lock" as AcquireReadLock #B9770E : **entry** seek directive_store read lock\n**allowed** concurrent compiles\n**forbidden** write-lock-while-awaiting-compile
state "Schema\nValidate" as SchemaValidate #1B7A6E : **entry** JSON Schema Draft-07\n**allowed** structural projection only\n**forbidden** skip complexity pass
state "Complexity\nValidate" as ComplexityValidate #1B7A6E : **entry** AST walk post-schema\n**allowed** depth≤32 · nodes≤256 · width≤64\nregex≤4096 · metadata≤16384 B\n**forbidden** schema-only conformance claim
state "Portability\nValidate" as PortabilityValidate #1B7A6E : **entry** RE2 · IEEE 754 finite\nUTC-Z · NFC · flags {i,m,s} only\n**forbidden** engine-specific regex
state "Discriminator\nValidate" as DiscriminatorValidate #1B7A6E : **entry** evaluator_type ↔ config\nAST discriminator (§2.9)\n**forbidden** weak if/then only
state "Lineage DAG\nValidate" as LineageValidate #1B7A6E : **entry** acyclicity · depth≤64\nparent existence · op cardinality\n**forbidden** self-reference
state "Hash Nodes" as HashNodes #1B7A6E : **entry** dual-hash model (§2.6)\nsemantic_hash = SHA-256(semantic_body)\npresentation_hash = SHA-256(presentation_body)\nnode_hash = SHA-256({semantic, presentation})\n**allowed** reuse evaluator subgraph if semantic_hash match\n**forbidden** embed neighbor context · include presentation in semantic_hash
state "Hash Edges" as HashEdges #1B7A6E : **entry** edge_hash = SHA-256(source, target)\n**allowed** directional depends_on only
state "Conflict\nMap" as ConflictMap #1B7A6E : **entry** resolve_conflict mapping\nprecedence §2.15\n**forbidden** bind cross-lineage
state "Snapshot\nHash" as SnapshotHash #1B7A6E : **entry** cg_ir_snapshot_hash =\nSHA-256(sorted node_hashes +\nsorted edge_hashes + provenance)\n**forbidden** include compiled_at (S-23)\nCAS: identical hash → dedup no-op
state "Policy Runtime\nProhibition Assert" as PolicyAssert #1B7A6E : **entry** AA-02 path assert\n**allowed** policy absent from runtime paths\n**forbidden** load policy_doctrine.yaml
state "Publish CAS" as Publish #2C6E49 : **entry** immutable snapshot write\n**allowed** dedup if hash exists\n**forbidden** in-place mutate
state "Release Lock\n(Success)" as ReleaseLockOk #2C6E49 : **entry** read lock released after publish\n**allowed** inspections may pin hash
state "Release Lock\n(Abort)" as ReleaseLockFail #A93226 : **entry** read lock released after fail\n**allowed** Directive Graph unchanged
state "Completed" as Completed #2C6E49 : **entry** snapshot live\n**allowed** pin by inspection\n**forbidden** mutate snapshot
state "Failed" as Failed #A93226 : **entry** no partial CG-IR\n**allowed** audit entry only\n**forbidden** publish · graph mutation

Requested --> Queued : <b>enqueue</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: schedule compile\nevent: CompileQueued
Queued --> AcquireReadLock : <b>dequeue</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: grant FIFO slot\nevent: CompileDequeued
AcquireReadLock --> SchemaValidate : <b>lock granted</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: acquire read lock\nevent: CompileLockAcquired
AcquireReadLock --> Queued : <b>blocked</b>\nactor: System\n[write lock held or write pending]\naction: retry FIFO\nevent: CompileLockDeferred

SchemaValidate --> ComplexityValidate : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System (Hermetic Compiler)\nevent: CompileGatePassed\naction: gate=schema
SchemaValidate --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGateFailed\naction: SchemaError · no partial CG-IR

ComplexityValidate --> PortabilityValidate : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGatePassed\naction: gate=complexity
ComplexityValidate --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGateFailed\naction: ComplexityError

PortabilityValidate --> DiscriminatorValidate : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGatePassed\naction: gate=portability
PortabilityValidate --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGateFailed\naction: PortabilityError

DiscriminatorValidate --> LineageValidate : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGatePassed\naction: gate=discriminator
DiscriminatorValidate --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGateFailed\naction: DiscriminatorError

LineageValidate --> HashNodes : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGatePassed\naction: gate=lineage · lineage_validation recorded
LineageValidate --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGateFailed\naction: LineageError

HashNodes --> HashEdges : <b>hash nodes</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileNodesHashed
HashEdges --> ConflictMap : <b>hash edges</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileEdgesHashed
ConflictMap --> SnapshotHash : <b>map conflicts</b>\nactor: System\naction: unresolved → conflict artifact meta\naction: cross-lineage advisory only\nevent: CompileConflictsMapped

SnapshotHash --> PolicyAssert : <b>compose snapshot hash</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileSnapshotHashed
PolicyAssert --> Publish : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGatePassed\naction: gate=AA-02
PolicyAssert --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileGateFailed\naction: ArchitecturalAuditError AA-02

Publish --> ReleaseLockOk : <b>CAS put</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: write-once publish\nevent: CgIrPublished
ReleaseLockOk --> Completed : <b>release read lock</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileLockReleased
Completed --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

Failed --> ReleaseLockFail : <b>always release lock</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CompileLockReleased
ReleaseLockFail --> [*] : <b>terminal abort</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

@enduml
